== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[níu]]'' "[[nine]]". Meaning '''twenty and nine'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''tuttugu og níu''' {{indecl}}

# [[twenty-nine]], cardinal number after [[tuttugu og átta]] and before [[þrjátíu]]

